outlawed since the Unification War. In her time with Dorothea, Marlya has managed to reunite with Veronica, uncover conspiratorial plots against the government, and even survive all out war against powerful Fairly Soldier foes. However, Veronica still has her vengeful hatred of Ray Dawn, the Duke who ordered the massacre at Suna, and Ray's own mysterious schemes will have Dorothea on the front lines again, sooner or later. Marlya will have to fight to save not just her friend, but the whole of the Empire.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["フェアリーゴーン 2",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-28701":"2020-08-15T13:31:47Z","serial-19478":"2020-01-13T03:43:29Z","serial-23999":"2020-03-22T21:01:46Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-28701","serial-19478","serial-23999"],"relatedMalIds":[39063],"availableEpisodeCount":12,"rating":6.36,"relations":[{"id":39063,"relation":"prequel"}]}]}